{"kind":"article","primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"text":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Swidux ships a companion agent skill (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"swidux-ref"},{"text":") for AI coding assistants like Claude Code. It contains the architecture rules, conventions, and code templates an assistant needs to generate correct Swidux code without you re-explaining the patterns.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The skill is published in ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/heirloomlogic\/skills","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" — Heirloom Logic’s public skills repo — alongside any future Heirloom skills. Two files:","type":"text"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"SKILL.md","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" — architecture rules (the 10 rules, the dispatch lifecycle, plugin shapes, anti-patterns)."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"swidux-patterns.md","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" — copy-pasteable code templates for "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AppState"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AppAction"},{"type":"text","text":", reducers, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AppStore"},{"text":" factory, views, plugin wiring, and Swift Testing reducer tests.","type":"text"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"text":"Installing the skill","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Installing-the-skill"},{"type":"heading","text":"GitHub CLI (recommended)","level":3,"anchor":"GitHub-CLI-recommended"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Requires "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"gh"},{"type":"text","text":" ≥ v2.90.0 ("},{"identifier":"https:\/\/cli.github.com","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":")."}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"bash","code":["gh skill install heirloomlogic\/skills swidux-ref --agent claude-code --scope user"]},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"--scope user","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" installs to "},{"code":"~\/.claude\/skills\/swidux-ref\/","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" (loads in every project)."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"--scope project"},{"type":"text","text":" installs to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"<cwd>\/.claude\/skills\/swidux-ref\/"},{"text":" (commit it so the whole team gets it).","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Pin a version with "},{"code":"swidux-ref@v1.2.3","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". List tags with ","type":"text"},{"code":"git ls-remote --tags https:\/\/github.com\/heirloomlogic\/skills","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Other agents: pass "},{"code":"--agent codex","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"--agent cursor","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"--agent gemini-cli","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", etc. Run ","type":"text"},{"code":"gh skill install --help","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" for the full list."}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"text":"skills.sh","type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"skillssh"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"bash","code":["npx skillsadd heirloomlogic\/skills"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Indexes the same source repo. Works without a GitHub CLI install."}]},{"level":3,"anchor":"Manual-no-gh-no-npx","type":"heading","text":"Manual (no `gh`, no `npx`)"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Claude Code uses "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".claude\/skills\/"},{"text":". Codex, Cursor, Gemini CLI, and others use ","type":"text"},{"code":".agents\/skills\/","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". Pick the director